manual/img/
manual/index.html
manual/manifest-*.txt

# Database dumps written by the admin "Create backup" button (owner, 2026-10-06).
# A dump is a copy of a world, not source: it is large, it changes every time it is taken, and it
# belongs on the server that can restore it rather than in the repository.
backups/
*.dump

# The working documents (owner, 2026-10-20: "sve md fajlove i archive folder iskljuci sa gita").
# They are the owner's own notes about the work in progress - the board, the logs, the reviews and
# the archive of the plans that were superseded. They stay on the machine that does the work; they
# are not part of what the repository publishes.
*.md
!/README.md

# The archive of the superseded planning: history, not source.
archive/

# The tool folders (owner, 2026-10-20: "verujem da treba izbaciti sve ove foldere sto pocinju tackom").
# They are one machine's settings - an IDE's project folder, a tool's SQLite database, an agent's
# policy file - and they say nothing about the game. They stay on the machine that made them.
.codebuddy/
.devin/
.harn/
.idea/
.settings/
.vtcode/
.DS_Store
